Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:06:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(machines): G-EDM Wire EDM (template) machine file

assets/machines/g-edm.mch: a wire_edm with X and Y, a guides head,
edm.awt false and controller.post "G-EDM Wire EDM". It states no
travel, rapid, guide height, taper, wire diameter, edm.codes or
condition: each G-EDM build is different, and the unstated-limits law
forbids a guess. With no condition the Wire Contour door (#531) refuses
the cut by the condition's name; with a measured condition it posts.
Registered in MACHINES and embedded(); the site machine table and the
post guide name it.

Fixes #2701

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
